      "writtenOn": "2024-03-19T08:19:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Offline discussed with motomu,\nthe real concern here is do we want to change the behavior of TrafficStats#get* API on U- devices , or should we only do this only on V+?\n\nRationale for T+:\n * Callers should not call this API x times per second. And we doesn\u0027t really do anything harmful, e.g. throw. Just return cached value within 1 sec.\n \nRationale for V+:\n * We don\u0027t really know if the behavior change is safe or not. It would be safer if no existing devices are impacted.\n \n\n@lorenzo@google.com @reminv@google.com to input.",
      "parentUuid": "b264fe38_98a96dc8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 515,
